#: apps/absences/services.py:313
msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough, and since RD 1060/2022 the worker does not hand the "
"certificate to the employer."
msgstr "El comunicat de baixa no s'emmagatzema. N'hi ha prou amb registrar l'absència, les seves dates i el seu estat, i des del RD 1060/2022 el treballador no lliura el comunicat a l'empresa."

#: apps/absences/services.py:330
#, python-format
msgid "There is already leave recorded between %(from)s and %(to)s."
msgstr "Ja hi ha una absència registrada entre el %(from)s i el %(to)s."

#: apps/absences/services.py:350
msgid ""
"Say which suspension it is: they carry different articles and different "
"consequences, and the record has to name one."
msgstr "Digues quina suspensió és: porten articles i conseqüències diferents, i el registre n'ha d'anomenar una."

#: apps/absences/services.py:359
msgid ""
"A reduction covers whole days at a smaller share. For hours away on one day, "
"leave the reduction empty."
msgstr "Una reducció cobreix dies sencers amb una jornada menor. Per a hores soltes d'un dia, deixa la reducció buida."

#: apps/absences/services.py:368
msgid ""
"Only a suspension can reduce the working day. For fewer hours by agreement, "
"change the contracted figure on the person."
msgstr "Només una suspensió pot reduir la jornada. Per a menys hores per acord, canvia les hores contractades de la persona."

#: apps/absences/services.py:385
msgid ""
"Only a suspension the company records --- an ERTE, the RED mechanism --- can "
"reduce the working day."
msgstr "Només una suspensió de les que registra l'empresa —un ERTO, el mecanisme XARXA— pot reduir la jornada."

#: apps/absences/services.py:394
msgid ""
"Holiday is taken in whole days. For part of a day, use the leave type that "
"fits: a medical appointment, family emergency, an exam."
msgstr "Les vacances es prenen per dies sencers. Per a part d'un dia fes servir el permís que correspongui: visita mèdica, força major familiar, un examen."

